{"id":"1f02670c94d12f9b","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-model6-principal-type.md","title":"ZFC Model6 Principal Type","display":"df-zfc-model6-principal-type — ZFC Model6 Principal Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model6-principal-type","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model6-principal-type"],"display":"df-zfc-model6-principal-type — ZFC Model6 Principal Type","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-type.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-model2-type-over-set]]","[[58-df-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model6-principal-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model6-principal-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model6-principal-type — ZFC Model6 Principal Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-type.md\">../batch10/58-df-type.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8065d4b679e8fd55\" href=\"?note=8065d4b679e8fd55\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model2-type-over-set\">58-df-zfc-model2-type-over-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"58-df-logic\">58-df-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (parameter-symbol set) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (tuple arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> (complete type over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-type.md\">../batch10/58-df-type.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> (principal formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\\)</span> (complete-type predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\models_{L(A)}\\psi\">\\(T\\models_{L(A)}\\psi\\)</span> (semantic consequence in the parameter expansion, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"58-df-logic\">58-df-logic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_n(\\psi)\\coloneqq\\forall v_0\\cdots\\forall v_{n-1}\\,\\psi\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_n(\\psi)\\coloneqq\\forall v_0\\cdots\\forall v_{n-1}\\,\\psi\\)</span> (universal closure over the designated variables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6PrincipalType}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6PrincipalType}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}principal\\text{-}type}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6PrincipalType}_S(L,A,T,p,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,A,T,L,n)\\land\\exists\\theta\\in p\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\\Bigl(T\\models_{L(A)}\\operatorname{ucl}_n(\\theta\\to\\varphi)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}principal\\text{-}type}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6PrincipalType}_S(L,A,T,p,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,A,T,L,n)\\land\\exists\\theta\\in p\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\\Bigl(T\\models_{L(A)}\\operatorname{ucl}_n(\\theta\\to\\varphi)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A principal type is complete and generated by one of its formulas. Semantic consequence is used so the definition does not depend on an undeclared proof calculus.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"c8dfa3853919882a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-type.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model2-type-over-set","status":"resolved","id":"8065d4b679e8fd55","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-model2-type-over-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"c8dfa3853919882a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p$ (complete type over $A$, see [[../batch10/58-df-type.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\models_{L(A)}\\psi$ (se